# - RELEASE: Gaia DR3
# - TABLE: xp_continuous_mean_spectrum
# - DESCRIPTION: >
#     Table hosting the mean BP and RP spectra based on the continuous representation in basis functions (see~\secref{cu5pho_ssec:meanSpecGen}).
#     
#     Note this table is not available through the main archive TAP interface. Data are delivered via the Massive Data service indexed by the VO Datalink protocol and described in Chapter~\ref{chap:archive}. For example this can be actioned in the archive user interface by querying the main source catalogue {\tt GaiaSource} and selecting {\tt hasXpContinuous}~{\tt = 't'}.
